OL,3,GNEWSATigers fans savouring the good
OL,4,Aform 'while it lasts'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Hull City fan has described his
OL,7,Fside's start to life back in the
OL,8,FPremier League as "beyond words" and
OL,9,Fadmits his ultimate dream is European
OL,10,Ffootball next season.
OL,12,F"I'm a bit crazy in the head!" said
OL,13,FOliver Swingler, 19, who is season
OL,14,Fticket holder.
OL,16,F"I'd like to go the classic stadiums.
OL,17,FYour San Siros, the Bernabeu, Camp Nou.
OL,18,FIt's exciting to think about. I don't
OL,19,Fthink it'll happen but you never know!"
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
